    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> +1 Quarterstaff. Each property once per dawn: <strong>Calm Emotions</strong> (DC 15); <strong>Dissuading Aura</strong> (Magic action, 1 minute - when a creature you can see ends its turn within 30 ft, the module offers a DC 15 WIS save or Frightened until the start of its next turn); <strong>Repel</strong> (Reaction when a creature comes within 5 ft - creatures of your choice within 30 ft make a DC 15 STR save or are pushed 30 ft; the module runs it).</p>",
